[00:11.02]Funny how fairy tales work
[00:13.48]When beautiful things start to hurt
[00:16.10]We didn’t make it this far to let go
[00:21.43]Still a familiar call
[00:24.00]Echoing what came before
[00:26.41]There’s guaranteed to be flames where there’s smoke
[00:30.48]Oh won’t you talk to me, if your words are bittersweet
[00:36.66]Play my broken strings on repeat, on repeat
[00:40.89]If you want more from me, when you’ve taken what you need
[00:46.95]Every missing piece fits like a puzzle to my heart, you can keep
